ta","data":[{"unit":1,"title":3,"area":120,"prev":122,"next":125,"titles":128,"firmware":297},{"id":2,"title":3,"aliases":4,"area":13,"order":14,"path":15,"context":16,"summary":20,"status":21,"firmware":22,"facts":26,"procedures":60,"parameters":82,"related":104,"body":107,"sources":108,"official_url":30,"controls":113},"instrument.filter-dynamic","Dynamic filter",[5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"dynamic","high pass","low pass","compress","compressor","drive","distortion","filter type","instrument",45,"knowledge/manual/units/instrument/filter-dynamic.md",{"modes":17,"screens":18},[13],[19],"M3","OS 1.2 adds a fifth filter type, dynamic. It works on the whole track rather than each voice: a high pass and a low pass, then a compressor and drive. Its four encoders are high pass, compress, drive and low pass.","changelog-only",{"min":23,"changed_in":24,"guide_version":25,"verified_on":25},"1.2.0",[],null,[27,32,37,40,43,47,49,51,54,57],{"id":28,"text":29,"source":30,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":31},"new-type","Dynamic is a filter type added in OS 1.2.0. It is picked from the filter type list, `shift + M3`, where it comes first, above ladder, svf, z hipass and z lowpass.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.2.0","official",{"id":33,"text":34,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"off-first","Right after you pick it the page reads off, and a press of `M3` switches it on, with both filters fully open and the compressor and drive at nothing.","docs/research/79b-os12-small-features.md#1-dynamic-filter-120","community-verified",{"id":38,"text":39,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"per-track","It filters the track's whole sound together, not each voice on its own, and it works on every track with a filter, drum and drumline tracks included.",{"id":41,"text":42,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"encoders","The four encoders are `E1` high pass (cuts lows), `E2` compress, `E3` drive and `E4` low pass (cuts highs). They keep the filter lanes, so MIDI CC 32–35 reach them as for the other types.",{"id":44,"text":45,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":46},"order","The sound goes through the high pass and low pass first, then the compressor, then the drive.","community",{"id":8,"text":48,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":46},"Compress works like a real compressor without make-up gain, so turning it up makes peaks quieter and the track more even, and the overall level drops.",{"id":10,"text":50,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":46},"Drive adds harmonics and lowers the level, ending at a fixed ceiling, so the sound gets brighter and more crushed rather than louder.",{"id":52,"text":53,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"screen","The page draws one curve for the high pass and low pass together, with two hatched bars under it for compress and drive. No value numbers are shown, only the frequency axis.",{"id":55,"text":56,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":46},"locks","The four values take parameter locks and automation like the other filter values.",{"id":58,"text":59,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":46},"envelope","With dynamic selected, the M2 filter envelope no longer drives a filter; it becomes a spare modulation source, and what it can reach is not known.",[61],{"id":62,"goal":63,"preconditions":64,"steps":67,"result":81,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"pick","Switch a track to the dynamic filter",[65,66],"instrument mode","the track is selected",[68,70,73,76,79],{"keys":19,"note":69,"set":25},"the filter page",{"keys":71,"note":72,"set":25},"shift + M3","the type list",{"keys":74,"note":75,"set":25},"turn E1","to dynamic, the first entry",{"keys":77,"note":78,"set":25},"click E1","picks it",{"keys":19,"note":80,"set":25},"switches the filter on","The page shows high pass, compress, drive and low pass, with the first and last fully open.",[83,89,94,99],{"screen":19,"encoder":84,"layer":85,"keys":74,"name":6,"range":86,"default":25,"cc":87,"cc_confidence":36,"note":88,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"E1","base","00–99",32,"closes from the low end; 00 is open",{"screen":19,"encoder":90,"layer":85,"keys":91,"name":8,"range":86,"default":25,"cc":92,"cc_confidence":36,"note":93,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"E2","turn E2",33,"compressor amount",{"screen":19,"encoder":95,"layer":85,"keys":96,"name":10,"range":86,"default":25,"cc":97,"cc_confidence":36,"note":98,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"E3","turn E3",34,"saturation amount",{"screen":19,"encoder":100,"layer":85,"keys":101,"name":7,"range":86,"default":25,"cc":102,"cc_confidence":36,"note":103,"source":35,"firmware_min":25,"verified_on":25,"confidence":36},"E4","turn E4",35,"closes from the high end; 99 is open",[105,106],"instrument.filter","instrument.engine-drumline","Use dynamic when you want to shape a whole track at once: trim the lows and highs of a layered\npad, squash a drum kit together with compress, or crunch a bass with drive. It is a track effect that\nsits in the filter slot, so a track either has dynamic or one of the voice filters, not both.",[109,111],{"url":30,"kind":110},"changelog",{"url":35,"kind":112},"research",[114,115,116,117,118,119],"key.m3","key.shift","encoder.1","encoder.2","encoder.3","encoder.4",{"id":13,"title":121},"Instrument",{"id":123,"title":124},"instrument.lfo-tremolo","Tremolo LFO (vibrato and tremolo)",{"id":126,"title":127},"instrument.lfo-value","Value LFO",{"basics.key-notation":129,"basics.main-modes":130,"basics.modules":131,"basics.track-buttons":132,"basics.linked-tracks":133,"basics.patterns-scenes-songs":134,"basics.workflow":135,"basics.firmware-versions":136,"hardware.layout":137,"hardware.power-and-charging":138,"har